# Feature — Multiple Wallets

## Overview
Users can create multiple wallets (Cash, BCA, OVO, GoPay, etc).
Each transaction is linked to a wallet.
Transfer between wallets is recorded but NOT counted as expense or income.

## Wallet Entity — wallet.dart
```dart
import 'package:freezed_annotation/freezed_annotation.dart';
part 'wallet.freezed.dart';

@freezed
class Wallet with _$Wallet {
  const factory Wallet({
    required String id,
    required String name,
    required String icon,        // emoji icon e.g. '💵', '🏦', '📱'
    required int balance,        // current balance in IDR
    required bool isDefault,     // only one wallet can be default
    required DateTime createdAt,
  }) = _Wallet;
}
```

## Hive Model — wallet_model.dart
```dart
@HiveType(typeId: 1)
class WalletModel extends HiveObject {
  @HiveField(0) late String id;
  @HiveField(1) late String name;
  @HiveField(2) late String icon;
  @HiveField(3) late int balance;
  @HiveField(4) late bool isDefault;
  @HiveField(5) late DateTime createdAt;
}
```

