## Screen Specifications

### wallets_page.dart
- Accessed from Settings or Home AppBar wallet selector
- AppBar: large title "Wallets"
- List of wallet cards: name, icon, balance (formatRupiah)
- Default wallet shows black checkmark badge
- FAB: "+" → add_wallet_page.dart
- Tap wallet → wallet_detail_page.dart
- Swipe to delete (cannot delete default wallet)
- Total balance row at top: sum of all wallets

### add_wallet_page.dart
- Modal bottom sheet
- Wallet name: TextField
- Icon picker: horizontal scroll of emoji options
- Initial balance: numeric input (formatRupiah)
- Set as default: iOS Toggle
- Save button: full-width black ElevatedButton

### wallet_detail_page.dart
- AppBar: wallet name + edit icon
- Balance card: large formatRupiah amount
- Transaction list filtered by this wallet
- Transfer button: "Transfer ⇄" → transfer_sheet.dart

### transfer_sheet.dart (bottom sheet)
- Title: "Transfer Between Wallets"
- From wallet: dropdown/picker (current wallet pre-selected)
- To wallet: dropdown/picker
- Amount: numeric input
- Notes: optional TextField
- Confirm button: full-width black "Transfer"
- Validation: from ≠ to, amount > 0, sufficient balance

